'LinearStudy.schemeModuleInternalExtSourceMap_add' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
LinearStudy.schemeModuleInternalExtSourceFunctor : (X : AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme) →
